ubstituting the known values of $A$ and $C,$ we can solve for $B:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8-1 & =A(1-4)^{2}+B(1)(1-4)+C(1) \\\\ 7 & =9A-3B+C \\\\ 7 & =9(\\frac{1}{2})-3B+1 \\\\ B & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{8-x}{x(x-4)^{2}}=\\frac{1}{2x}-\\frac{1}{2(x-4)}+\\frac{1}{(x-4)^{2}}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate this expression term by term and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{8-x}{x(x-4)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}(\\frac{1}{2x}-\\frac{1}{2(x-4)}+\\frac{1}{(x-4)^{2}})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x-\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{x-4}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{(x-4)^{2}}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|\\,{|}_{1}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x-4|\\,{|}_{1}^{2}-\\frac{1}{x-4}\\,{|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\operatorname{ln}⁡1)-\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)-(-\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{2}+\\frac{1}{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534890 true] [17592186317774 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317775 13194139534890 true] [17592186317774 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317776 13194139534890 true] [17592186317774 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534890 true] [17592186317774 1041 "field-1" 13194139534890 true] [17592186317774 1104 #edb/ref 17592186317775 13194139534890 true] [17592186317774 1110 #uuid "a84a7c1a-381f-5ecf-8c7a-54d3630dcb7d" 13194139534890 true] [17592186317775 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(3)+\\frac{1}{6}" 13194139534890 true] [17592186317775 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534890 true] [17592186317775 1111 #uuid "a23ce9b4-4fa6-53f0-a3c5-7ee5114d937f" 13194139534890 true] [17592186317776 1034 "0" 13194139534890 true] [17592186317776 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534890 true] [17592186317776 1111 #uuid "94d2adad-5115-5fb1-abac-1a26125f244e" 13194139534890 true] [17592186317777 1017 #edb/ref 17592186317778 13194139534890 true] [17592186317777